<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{subject}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Google Sans', Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.30), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
        }
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            width: 125px;
            height: auto;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }
        .detail-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .detail-table td {
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f3f4;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .detail-table td:first-child {
            width: 40%;
            color: #70757a;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #70757a;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #dadce0;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://timemoz.com/logo.png" alt="Timemoz Logo" class="logo">

            <p>Hi <strong>Finance</strong>,</p>
            <p>A manual subscription ends in 7 days. Please follow up with the customer and record the renewal (extend) in the admin dashboard before the end date, or the company enters its grace period and is then locked.</p>

            <table class="detail-table">
                <tr><td>Company</td><td>{{companyName}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Plan</td><td>{{planName}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>End date</td><td>{{endDate}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Company ID</td><td>{{companyUuid}}</td></tr>
            </table>

            {{#if adminUrl}}
            <p><a href="{{adminUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 24px; background-color: #1a73e8; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;">Open company in admin dashboard</a></p>
            {{/if}}
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <p style="margin: 0;">Notification System<br /><strong>Timemoz</strong></p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">Jl. Mampang Prapatan Raya no 17c, Mampang Prapatan, Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia, 12790</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">&copy; 2026 Timemoz, Jakarta, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
